Package: eddyspapersbackend
Type: Package
Title: Semantic Economics Paper Search Engine Backend
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R: person("Eduard", "Brüll", email = "eduard.bruell@zew.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Data pipeline for a semantic economics paper search engine.
    Handles syncing RePEc archives, parsing RDF files, generating embeddings,
    and managing the DuckDB database. Serving is handled by the Node/Hono API.
